# ========================================
# ===== STATUS & STORAGE Http =====
# ========================================
# ----- 先执行 02-session.http 登录 -----


### 获取系统状态
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/system/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取存储最新快照（auto-scale 格式，含 name/type）
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/system/storage
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 刷新存储状态 (Admin only)
POST {{addr}}/api/admin/system/storage/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取存储历史（auto-scale 格式）
GET {{addr}}/api/admin/system/storage/share/history?days=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
